---
---

<section id="problema" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title animate-on-scroll">Problema y Tipo de Tarea</h2>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="card problem-card animate-on-scroll" data-delay="0s">
        <span class="problem-label">Pregunta de investigacion</span>
        <p class="problem-question">
          ¿Pueden los patrones de uso de redes sociales y habitos de vida de adolescentes (13-19 anos) predecir su nivel de riesgo de salud mental?
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="task-col">
        <div class="card task-card animate-on-scroll" data-delay="0.1s">
          <span class="task-badge">Tipo de tarea</span>
          <h3 class="task-type">Clasificacion Supervisada Multiclase</h3>
          <p class="task-desc">3 clases: Bajo, Medio, Alto</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card target-card animate-on-scroll" data-delay="0.2s">
          <span class="task-badge target-badge">Variable objetivo</span>
          <div class="target-formula">
            <code>mental_health_risk</code>
            <span class="formula-eq">=</span>
            <span class="formula-body">promedio(stress, anxiety, addiction)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="threshold-row">
            <span class="badge badge-green">Bajo ≤ 4</span>
            <span class="badge badge-amber">Medio 4-7</span>
            <span class="badge badge-red">Alto > 7</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .problem-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--cyan);
  }

  .problem-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .problem-question {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .task-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .task-card {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .task-badge {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 600;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 10%, transparent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .target-badge {
    color: var(--green);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 10%, transparent);
  }

  .task-type {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .task-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .target-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .target-formula {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .target-formula code {
    color: var(--green);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 8%, transparent);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .formula-eq {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .formula-body {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .threshold-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .problem-question {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
